            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "a wrapping, covering (OED fold n.3 3), however this clearly has something to do with armor, here with mail (Cobb 179 'faulds, skirts of metal hoops' cross-referencing aprons, mail) | a wrapping, covering (OED fold n.3 3), however this clearly has something to do with armour (usually together with flankers) | a wrapping, covering (OED s.v. fold n.3 3), however this clearly has something to do with armour (usually together with flankers) | a wrapping, covering (OED s.v. fold n.3 (3)), however this clearly has something to do with armor (here imported together with gussettes) | some kind of armor, but exact meaning unknown | fold is a wrapping, covering (OED fold n.3 3), however this clearly has something to do with armor, here with mail (Cobb 179 'faulds, skirts of metal hoops' cross-referencing aprons, mail)" ;
